Test runner process exited with code 134 (SIGABRT) during
'ProductGallery renders 500 thumbnails without jank'.

Final heap snapshot before the crash: 1.92GB RSS, up from a 340MB
baseline at suite start. The gallery component keeps an in-memory
cache of decoded thumbnail bitmaps keyed by product id and never
evicts entries, even for products scrolled far out of view. This
test is the first in the suite to render a large enough catalog
(500 items) to push the cache past available heap on the CI runner
(2GB limit).
